"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 6.88,
"text": "Emma's question is now a row of 100 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 7.182,
"end": 11.629,
"text": "The last one sits at the very end, where the answer is about to begin."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 12.186,
"end": 19.175,
"text": "Before the model writes a word, this position has to find out which earlier tokens matter."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 19.925,
"end": 24.0,
"text": "Attention gives every token three new vectors."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 24.476,
"end": 27.065,
"text": "A query: what am I looking for?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 27.622,
"end": 30.095,
"text": "A key: what do I contain?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 30.571,
"end": 35.482,
"text": "And a value: what I will pass on, if I am chosen."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 36.232,
"end": 41.306,
"text": "All three are made from the token's own vector, by three learned matrices."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 41.863,
"end": 47.749,
"text": "In block 24, head 2, each one is 64 numbers long."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 48.499,
"end": 54.153,
"text": "Now the last position sends out its query, to every key so far, its own included."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 54.629,
"end": 59.018,
"text": "Multiply query and key, number by number, and add it all up."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 59.366,
"end": 62.988,
"text": "That is a dot product: one score per token."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 63.452,
"end": 66.982,
"text": "When the two point the same way, the score is high."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 67.732,
"end": 73.049,
"text": "Divided by 8, the square root of 64, the scores come out like this."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 73.456,
"end": 77.159,
"text": "Manchester, in Emma's question: 7.8."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 77.519,
"end": 81.002,
"text": "The Manchester in the system prompt: 5.4."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 81.362,
"end": 83.371,
"text": "Stores: 4.5."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 83.591,
"end": 85.867,
"text": "And battery, only 1.4."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 86.169,
"end": 89.698,
"text": "This head is looking for a place, not an item."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 90.448,
"end": 94.709,
"text": "Softmax turns the scores into weights that add up to one."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 95.266,
"end": 101.222,
"text": "Every lead is magnified: 2.4 points ahead becomes ten times the weight."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 101.779,
"end": 104.31,
"text": "Manchester now takes 65 percent."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 104.67,
"end": 107.585,
"text": "The other 99 positions share the rest."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 108.335,
"end": 109.67,
"text": "Then the values."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 110.03,
"end": 113.432,
"text": "Each one steps forward, scaled by its weight."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 113.989,
"end": 116.625,
"text": "Manchester, at almost full strength."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 117.031,
"end": 118.331,
"text": "The rest, faint."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 118.738,
"end": 123.614,
"text": "Added together, they make one new vector of 64 numbers."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 124.364,
"end": 130.006,
"text": "That is what this head passes up: mostly, what Manchester means in this sentence."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 130.308,
"end": 136.229,
"text": "The query asks, the keys answer, and the values are mixed by how well they matched."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 136.88,
"end": 141.686,
"text": "Fourteen heads do this side by side, in each of 24 blocks."
}
]
}